<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "環境音\chilly_hell.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "3000" "WAIT"}
{PLAYMOVIE "光2.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "0" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n255\r\n5000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "5000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n255\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>A sea of light, filling a pitch-black space.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My feet touching no ground, unable even to tell which way was up and which was down.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Maybe this is how you lose yourself when you're caught in an avalanche―<PG>
But it wasn't cold.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If anything, it was warm.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My hands, especially, were very warm.<PG>
Where am I supposed to go from here?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Will someone properly come to take me?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Will I be taken to heaven, or dropped into hell―<PG>
"―<STYLE ID="1">Natsumi-chan</STYLE>... 
{PAUSE ""}
can you hear me?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A voice calling me―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Is it the person who'll take me to the other world?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I... died, after all.<PG>
But it was a voice I had heard long, long ago.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A voice that brought back memories.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A voice I always used to hear close by.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\夢見る憧憬.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "SE" "10000" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\栄一郎バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"That's right. It seems my voice has finally reached you."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was the first time I had heard it so clearly.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Thanks to </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> was saved."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE> was saved?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Thank goodness.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I see. If <STYLE ID="3">Ojisan</STYLE>'s here, then I really did die.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Ojisan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, I... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I've always wanted to apologize. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Because I let the balloon get away..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Ha ha, that doesn't matter anymore. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">All this time, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'ve stayed by </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Mifuyu-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, and I am very grateful for it."</STYLE><PG>
I didn't stay by their side out of guilt.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="4">Obasan</STYLE> are both people I can't do without in my life.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That's why we've been able to be happy all this time.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Ojisan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, if </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s safe, does that mean </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> was stopped?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"As for </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">my brother</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, I held him down. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">So everyone is safe."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Held him down...?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　So that's what happened. Thank you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Ojisan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">. I absolutely didn't want </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> to die."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"It's true. If </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> hadn't shielded </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> back then, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> would not have survived."</STYLE><PG>
I didn't shield her for nothing, then.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I could use this life for <STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE>'s sake, I have no regrets left.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But―
{PAUSE ""}
if <STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE> and I really were sisters―
{PAUSE ""}
only now do I find myself longing for a life like that.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Ojisan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, is </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> really my older sister?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\栄一郎頭かく.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Ha ha, so that </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">brother</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> of mine let it slip after all. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\栄一郎バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">Well, a lot happened. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Ryoji</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> and the others meant to tell </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> when you turned 20, it seems, but it's come a little early..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I'm happy that </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s my older sister. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">... would she be happy too...?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"If </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'re happy about it, then I'm sure </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> is happy too. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">No, she must be happy."</STYLE><PG>
At the same time, I was struck by a sadness that threatened to crush me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'll never see <STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE> again.<PG>
I wanted to call her 'Sis' at least once.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But <STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE> would definitely say, 'Quit calling me that.'
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I suddenly called her 'Sis,' <STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE> would definitely get flustered and say, 'Are you an idiot!?'<PG>
Just imagining it is fun, and yet―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'm happy that <STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE>'s my big sister, and yet―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But―never again, with <STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE>―!<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"I wanted to call her Sis at least once... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">We finally found out we're sisters, and to be parted the very moment we did..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Tears clung to my face.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A world with no gravity, no body―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even in a place like that, my tears alone flowed just as they had in the world of the living.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Then you should call her 'Sis.'"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Would she even hear my voice from this world...? I died, after all."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\光.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "$FFFFFF" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "200" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="STOPMOVIE">
{PLAYMOVIE "光.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "0" "255"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> haven't died. You're alive."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Huh!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That can't be...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There's no way I could have survived a blow like that.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It wouldn't be strange if my body had been cut clean in two.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"See, how do </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">your</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> hands feel?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My hands...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Come to think of it, they had been warm the whole time, ever since I came here.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A very gentle, comfortable warmth.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
As if they were filling me with love, so warm―<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Try squeezing those hands."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"My hands...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I poured every nerve I had into my hands.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In this world where my body wouldn't do as I wanted, I focused my mind so I could move my hands.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\光.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "11" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">! Come back! If you can squeeze my hand back, you can come back, right!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\光.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "11" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="7">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">, don't die! Everyone's waiting for you!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\光.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "人物2" "11" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
I heard them! It's <STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="7">Goto</STYLE>!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The warmth in these hands―<STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="7">Goto</STYLE> had been holding them all along.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Right now, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'ve been knocked unconscious by </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">my brother</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s attack. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'ll go back once you open your eyes."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Then I'm going back to </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> and the others!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　Because... everyone's waiting for me!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Yes, that's for the best. Everyone needs </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">But before that, I'd like you to make me two promises."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Promises...?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"He did this to </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">my brother</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> did, but... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">please don't blame </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">my brother</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">. </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">My brother</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> had no choice but to do what he did."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"You mean, like </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> said, he doesn't want the truth to be known?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"That's right... </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">My brother</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> would sooner become a murderer, or a condemned man, than let the truth be known."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"So you mean it's better if we don't know the truth?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"If you were to learn the truth, I'm sure not a single person could be happy. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">My brother</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> is trying to prevent that by playing the villain himself. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">But if </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> hear my voice again, you might reach the truth. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">So you will never hear my voice again."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"So even when cherry blossom season comes, my intuition won't work anymore..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"That's the first promise. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">And the other one is―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">please, always stay by </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s side. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> gets lonely very easily, and she's afraid of being alone."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Of course! Just like </STYLE><STYLE ID="8">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Obasan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, we'll always be together!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Hearing that is all I need. For the rest of your life, you can live happily without relying on my voice. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">As long as you never learn the truth, that is."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Okay. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Um... how do I go back...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Try squeezing their hands hard once more. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Then </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> and the others should wake you up."</STYLE><PG>
Squeeze hard...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Focusing even harder than before, I put strength into my hands.<PG>
Then, the feeling of my body being shaken―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And I began to feel gravity, and the presence of people too.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n11\r\n30\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n456\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n30\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n11\r\n30\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{MOTION "456" "ムービー" "11" "30" "0" "NORMAL" "WAIT"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">Ojisan</STYLE>'s figure, and the scenery behind him, began to blur.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Ojisan</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, thank you for everything! I'll never, ever forget you!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Take good care of </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Mifuyu-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, I'm counting on you!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\光.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "$FFFFFF" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "200" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="STOPMOVIE">
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">Ojisan</STYLE>'s figure and the scenery both vanished.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
All that's left is to open my eyes, and I can go back to <STYLE ID="2">Haruka</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="7">Goto</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Wait for me. I'll see you very soon.
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
